@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy / About";
}

<div class="container mt-5">
    <h2 class="mb-4 text-primary">About the Project</h2>

    <p class="lead">
        The <b>User Management WebApp</b> is a simple web application built with ASP.NET Core MVC
        for managing users: creating, editing, deleting, searching, and organizing data efficiently.
    </p>

    <hr />

    <h4>Main Features:</h4>
    <ul class="list-group mb-4">
        <li class="list-group-item">Add new users</li>
        <li class="list-group-item">Edit existing users</li>
        <li class="list-group-item">Delete user records</li>
        <li class="list-group-item">Search by name or email</li>
        <li class="list-group-item">Sorting by different fields</li>
        <li class="list-group-item">Pagination (split into pages)</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>About the Developer:</h4>
    <p>
        Developer: <b>Imran</b> <br />
        Version: <b>1.0</b> <br />
        Date: @DateTime.Now.ToString("MMMM dd, yyyy")
    </p>

    <div class="alert alert-info mt-4">
        ⚡ This is an educational project, but it can be extended into a real-world web application
        with authentication, role management, and advanced analytics.
    </div>
</div>
